The {{Keyword|shop|Soul Shop|}} is unlocked after reaching 5 minutes of unscaled playtime. In here, you can buy:
*[[Soul Shop#Boosts|Boosts]] for various game mechanics
*Hours of {{Icon|time flux|link=Time Flux}} {{Keyword|tf|Time Flux|link=Time Flux}}
*Quality of Life (QoL) features, such as more [[Zodiacs|Zodiac]] Slots
*[[skins|Skins]] to customize your [[revolution|Revolution]] tab
*More {{Icon|soul_icon}} {{Keyword|soul|Souls}} for real money, in the form of [[Soul Shop#Soul Packs|Soul Packs]]
*[[Soul Shop#Ascension Packs|Ascension Packs]] for real money, which contain Boosts, Skins and {{Icon|soul_icon}} {{Keyword|soul|Souls}} 

''It is generally recommended to only buy {{Icon|time flux}} {{Keyword|tf|Time Flux}} Gain because it is the only resource which is relevant throughout all stages of the game. Other recommended upgrades (for QoL) are Zodiac Slots and Macro Slots.''

== Souls ==
{{Icon|soul_icon}} {{Keyword|soul|Souls}} are the currency used in the {{Keyword|shop|Soul Shop|}}. Players can earn {{Icon|soul_icon}} {{Keyword|soul|Souls}} through the following methods:
* Claiming [[Soul_Shop#Codes|Codes]]
* As [[Daily Rewards]] (averaging to ≈232 {{Icon|soul_icon}} {{Keyword|soul|Souls}}/day)
* As {{Keyword|ach|Achievement|link=Achievements}} Rewards
** Up to a total of 37,675 {{Icon|soul_icon}} {{Keyword|soul|Souls}} are available as both Normal and Secret achievement rewards (as of v1.034)
* Purchased via [[Soul Shop#Soul Packs|Soul Packs]]

== Boosts ==
Players can purchase boosts for {{Icon|time flux}} {{Keyword|tf|Time Flux}} and other different game-play mechanics they have unlocked so far, with the most recent major reset layer's options at the very top.
Unless stated otherwise, all Soul Boosts are multiplicative with other bonuses with similar effects
