== Time Flux ==
{{Keyword|TF|Time Flux|link=Time Flux}} {{Icon|time flux}} can be purchased with {{Keyword|soul|Souls}} {{Icon|soul_icon}}, as follows:
*2 hours: {{Keyword|soul|3,000}} {{Icon|soul_icon}} (''{{Keyword|soul|1,500}} {{Icon|soul_icon}} per hour'')
*8 hours:  {{Keyword|soul|10,000}} {{Icon|soul_icon}} (''{{Keyword|soul|1,250}} {{Icon|soul_icon}} per hour'')
*24 hours:  {{Keyword|soul|25,000}} {{Icon|soul_icon}} (''{{Keyword|soul|1,042}} {{Icon|soul_icon}} per hour'')

== Soul Packs ==
{{Keyword|soul|Souls}} {{Icon|soul_icon}} can be purchased with real money in the Packs tab within the Soul Shop.
The following Soul Packs are available to buy:
*Souls Pack 1: {{Keyword|soul|2,000}} {{Icon|soul_icon}}
*Souls Pack 2: {{Keyword|soul|11,000}} {{Icon|soul_icon}}
*Souls Pack 3: {{Keyword|soul|50,000}} {{Icon|soul_icon}}
*Ultra Souls Pack: {{Keyword|soul|130,000}} {{Icon|soul_icon}}
*Legendary Souls Pack: {{Keyword|soul|280,000}} {{Icon|soul_icon}}
''The cost and relative value of Soul Packs varies based on your local currency. It may be worth checking if the claims of how many "bonus" souls you are getting with each pack are true before you buy, as some discrepancies have been found between different currencies.

== Ascension Packs ==
