== Codes ==
Codes can be redeemed within the Soul Shop by pressing the "Add a code" button (QR code icon) at the top-left, entering the code and pressing "Add".

Warning: Some codes can be missing or are no longer working, if you are desperate, check in the official discord server for the codes.

The following Codes can be redeemed, awarding {{Keyword|soul|Souls}} {{Icon|soul_icon}}, {{Keyword|TF|Time Flux}}
({{Keyword|TF|TF}}) {{Icon|time flux}}, or both. Some Codes can only unlock a [[Secret Achievements|Secret Achievement]].

Working codes:

*BYEBYE2025 ({{Keyword|soul|2,025}} {{Icon|soul_icon}}) - Requires version #1.051+

*WELCOME2026  ({{Keyword|soul|2,026}} {{Icon|soul_icon}}) - Requires version #1.051+

*PROSPERITYBONUS ({{Keyword|soul|500}} {{Icon|soul_icon}} & {{Keyword|TF|15:00 TF}} {{Icon|time flux}}) - Requires version #1.056+

<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="width:400px; overflow:auto;">
* UNITY ({{Keyword|secret|Secret Ach. 007|link=Secret Achievements}}) - Secret Code
</div>

Codes can be redeemed only once per account.

New codes are often added when new content is released, and older codes may be withdrawn/stop working.

